{'symbol': 'ITW', 'date': '2021-04-08 09:16:00', 'title': 'ITW SCHEDULES FIRST QUARTER 2021 EARNINGS WEBCAST', 'text': 'GLENVIEW, ILL., APRIL 08, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ILLINOIS TOOL WORKS INC. (NYSE: ITW) WILL ISSUE ITS FIRST QUARTER 2021 RESULTS ON FRIDAY, APRIL 30, 2021 AT 7:00 A.M. CDT. FOLLOWING THE RELEASE, ITW WILL HOLD ITS FIRST QUARTER EARNINGS WEBCAST AT 9:00 A.M. CDT.'}